<title>USA: Orange Cty, Fla., housing bonds repriced, ylds cut.</title>
<headline>Orange Cty, Fla., housing bonds repriced, ylds cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns &amp; Co. said Wednesday it repriced Orange County Housing Finance Authority, Fla.'s $30 million bond deal, lowering yields in the 2027 and 2028 maturities.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
<p>ORANGE COUNTY HOUSING FINANCE AUTHORITY</p>
<p>(ORANGE COUNTY, FLORIDA)</p>
<p>RE: $29,995,000*</p>
<p>SINGLE FAMILY MORTGAGE REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>(GNMA AND FANNIE MAE MORTGAGE-BACKED</p>
<p>SECURITITES PROGRAM)</p>
<p>SERIES 1997B</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>SUBJECT TO ALTERNATIVE MINIMUM TAX</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: NR		    S&amp;P: AAA</p>
<p>    DATED: 06/01/1997	  FIRST COUPON: 09/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 03/01 &amp; 09/01</p>
<p>ALL BONDS ARE PRICED AT PAR.</p>
<p>MATURITY		AMOUNT*   AMOUNT*   COUPON</p>
<p>			   (3/1)    (9/1)</p>
<p>1998			--	 120M    4.00  %</p>
<p>1999		     195M	200M    4.30  %</p>
<p>2000		     200M	210M    4.45  %</p>
<p>2001		     215M	220M    4.625 %</p>
<p>2002		     230M	230M    4.75  %</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>2003		     240M	245M    4.85  %</p>
<p>2004		     255M	255M    4.95  %</p>
<p>2005		     270M	275M    5.05  %</p>
<p>2006		     280M	295M    5.15  %</p>
<p>2007		     300M	305M    5.20  %</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>2008		     320M	325M    5.30  %</p>
<p>2009		     340M	350M    5.40  %</p>
<p>2010		     355M	370M    5.50  %</p>
<p>2017			--     3,780M    5.80  %</p>
<p>2027			--     9,000M    5.10  %</p>
<p>					    (Super Sinker)</p>
<p>(Avg. Life: 4.92 years based on 100% of FHA experience)</p>
<p>2028		  10,615M	 --     5.875 %</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: 09/01/2007    102.00</p>
<p>		   DTP 09/01/2009</p>
<p>PLEASE SEE PAGES 6-13 OF PRELIMINARY OFFICIAL STATEMENT FOR SPECIAL REDEMPTION FEATURES.</p>
<p>* - APPROXIMATE SUBJECT TO CHANGE</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Thursday, June 12, 1997.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on June 26, 1997.</p>
<p>This issue is book entry through DTC.</p>
